This file marks the agentic-os template as not-yet-configured.

When present, the SessionStart bootstrap-check hook injects a directive
telling the interface agent to invoke the `os-bootstrap` skill before
doing other work. The skill interviews the operator, resolves placeholder
agent names (`<interface-agent>`, `<senior-advisor>`, etc.), populates
memory tier scaffolds, and removes this sentinel.

To skip bootstrap and use the template in placeholder mode, delete this
file manually. Hooks and routing depending on agent names will silent-pass
on unresolved `<placeholder>` strings.
